  "post_content": "<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span lang=\"CA\" style=\"margin: 0px; line-height: 115%;\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\">(16 fotos) Un hombre de Val&egrave;ncia&nbsp;ha sido&nbsp;trasladado a mediod&iacute;a de&nbsp;este s&aacute;bado&nbsp;en helic&oacute;ptero al Hospital la Fe, tras sufrir un accidente mientras conduc&iacute;a su bicicleta en el kil&oacute;metro 6,400, a la bajada de Villamalur, junto a la rambla, y salirse de la v&iacute;a.</font></span></span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540406.jpg\" alt=\"p1540406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540409.jpg\" alt=\"p1540409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540410.jpg\" alt=\"p1540410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540412.jpg\" alt=\"p1540412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540415.jpg\" alt=\"p1540415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540417.jpg\" alt=\"p1540417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540418.jpg\" alt=\"p1540418\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/accidentciclistavillamalur250317/p1540419.jpg\" alt=\"p1540419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-